{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"observedRates"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR19ObservedSignalRatesV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ObservedSignalRates","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/ObservedSignalRates"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every trust window is a frame count derived from the CONFIGURED rate,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deliberately — certification needs a reproducible operating point, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a measured rate fed back would make timing drift with load. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"documented corollary is that a host whose real throughput differs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should SURFACE that difference. Nothing did, so a pipeline quietly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"running at half its configured rate took twice as long to revoke"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trust as it was tuned to, with nothing on screen saying so."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Forward a TrueDepth verdict from the host’s depth pipeline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into the evaluator. The session owns no camera or depth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hardware — depth wiring stays in the host (per the SDK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary), but the per-frame trust decision needs the verdict to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drive the depth-primary gate."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"What the three signals are ACTUALLY running at, against what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline’s timing was derived from."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustsession\/observedrates()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustSession"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"observedRates"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR19ObservedSignalRatesV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ObservedSignalRates"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:5YEOFR16FaceTrustSessionC13observedRatesAA014ObservedSignalF0VyF","role":"symbol","title":"observedRates()","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustSession\/observedRates()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustSession/observedRates()":{"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustsession\/observedrates()","title":"observedRates()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Forward a TrueDepth verdict from the host’s depth pipeline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into the evaluator. The session owns no camera or depth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hardware — depth wiring stays in the host (per the SDK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary), but the per-frame trust decision needs the verdict to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drive the depth-primary gate."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"What the three signals are ACTUALLY running at, against what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline’s timing